{
  "note": [
    "The Machine Shop's fabric (DR-106, the mech wing), cut from the one Kalamontee layout in scripts/fabric-kalamontee.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. 7 x 3.6 x 8, the eye at the middle, as wide as the end hall north of it. The game: \"some sort of machine shop filled with a variety of unusual machines. Doorways lead north, east, and west. Standing against the rear wall is a large dispensing machine with a spout\" and its nine buttons (compone.zil 1640-1659).",
    "The chemical dispenser on the rear (south) wall on the axis: its strip of nine buttons, the spout 0.75 m up and a grate on the floor under it where a flask or canteen stands. A mill, a vat, a lathe and a press in the four corners; the lanes between the doorways and to the dispenser kept clear. North, the 2.4 x 2.8 doorway onto Mech Corridor South and the one line up to the Transportation Supply's portal, 90 m out; west and east, 1.6 x 2.4 doorways 0.64 m north of the eye: the Tool Room's shelving, the Robot Shop's benches and half-built robot."
